00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:07.840
She's able to return home thanks to the arrival in power of fighters from the Islamist group

00:04:08.200 --> 00:04:10.600
HTS, Hayat Tahrir al-Chan.

00:04:11.440 --> 00:04:12.960
They are led by a young commander,

00:04:13.280 --> 00:04:14.600
Abu Mohammed al-Jolani.

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:18.080
He's 42 years old and a former jihadist,

00:04:18.600 --> 00:04:20.160
labelled a terrorist by the West.

00:04:21.040 --> 00:04:25.280
He now embodies both the fears and the hopes of an entire people.

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:30.160
Syria belongs to us, not to the Assad family.

00:04:30.320 --> 00:04:33.040
We have destroyed them.
We've finally destroyed them.

00:04:34.520 --> 00:04:35.360
For the past week,

00:04:35.720 --> 00:04:37.800
since the 8th of December 2024,

00:04:38.280 --> 00:04:39.920
Damascus has been celebrating.

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:45.280
The statues of the Assad's father and son have been knocked down and destroyed.

00:04:46.080 --> 00:04:49.800
The debris of 50 years of dictatorship lies on the ground.

00:04:50.400 --> 00:04:53.360
We have brought down tyranny.

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:58.800
We have brought down the entire
Syrian intelligence and terror system.

00:04:58.960 --> 00:05:03.920
It's the end of Bashar
and his Iranian and Russian allies.

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:07.400
The most powerful in the region have fled,

00:05:07.960 --> 00:05:11.400
with President Bashar al-Assad and his family the first to go.

00:05:12.560 --> 00:05:14.560
Their residence and the presidential palace,

00:05:14.800 --> 00:05:16.800
a hitherto inaccessible fortress,

00:05:17.320 --> 00:05:19.120
were abandoned to the Syrian people,

00:05:19.600 --> 00:05:22.000
who have taken back control over their destiny.

00:05:22.400 --> 00:05:23.680
The palace has been emptied,

00:05:24.240 --> 00:05:25.880
every nook and cranny searched,

00:05:26.240 --> 00:05:28.160
and one wing ravaged by fire.

00:05:33.280 --> 00:05:34.840
Here and throughout the country,

00:05:35.360 --> 00:05:40.040
portraits of the dictator and his father are being trampled underfoot or burned.

00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:42.920
It all began 12 days prior.

00:05:48.360 --> 00:05:49.400
For over a decade,

00:05:49.560 --> 00:05:56.440
the power of Damascus has been undermined in the northeast by Kurdish forces and in the west by Islamist factions.

00:05:57.240 --> 00:05:58.080
It was in the west,

00:05:58.320 --> 00:05:59.360
in the Idlib region,

00:05:59.760 --> 00:06:01.160
that the offensive was launched.

00:06:04.520 --> 00:06:07.440
It was a lightning strike by Al-Jolani and his men.

00:06:11.360 --> 00:06:11.600
On 27th

00:06:12.440 --> 00:06:13.840
November 2024,

00:06:14.280 --> 00:06:17.200
his jihadist rebel group Hayat Tahrir al-Sham

00:06:17.720 --> 00:06:20.120
HTS, formerly a branch of Al-Qaeda,

00:06:20.640 --> 00:06:22.360
announced the start of its offensive.

00:06:23.360 --> 00:06:25.400
The first objective was to take Aleppo,

00:06:25.800 --> 00:06:27.040
the country's second city.

00:06:27.760 --> 00:06:29.120
The fighting was fierce.

00:06:29.680 --> 00:06:32.160
200 people were killed in 48 hours.

00:06:33.080 --> 00:06:33.920
After three days,

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:35.480
the city fell to the rebels.

00:06:36.280 --> 00:06:38.160
The jihadis then took the road south,

00:06:38.600 --> 00:06:40.960
and the towns began to collapse one by one.

00:06:41.840 --> 00:06:48.320
In the name of Allah the merciful, I inform you that our
rother fighters have begun to penetrate the city of Hama

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:52.240
Next stop,

00:06:52.480 --> 00:06:52.840
Homs,

00:06:52.840 --> 00:06:55.280
160 km from the capital.

00:06:58.000 --> 00:06:58.480
On the way,

00:06:58.840 --> 00:07:05.160
the Islamist rebels took hundreds of supporters of the Assad dynasty prisoner and forced them to sing for the cameras.

00:07:07.120 --> 00:07:09.600
Assad damn your soul!

00:07:09.760 --> 00:07:13.040
God, Syria, the free army..

00:07:13.200 --> 00:07:16.560
God, Syria, the free army..

00:07:16.720 --> 00:07:19.840
God, Syria, the free army...

00:07:21.560 --> 00:07:24.120
Finally, on 8 December 2024,

00:07:24.520 --> 00:07:29.400
the HTS rebels converged on Damascus and seized strategic positions.

00:07:30.200 --> 00:07:33.280
Bashar al-Assad's regime was officially overthrown.

00:07:34.440 --> 00:07:38.840
People's first instinct was to go north of Damascus to Sayed Naya prison,

00:07:39.680 --> 00:07:41.480
nicknamed the human slaughterhouse.

00:07:42.480 --> 00:07:44.920
Tens of thousands of political prisoners were held,

00:07:45.280 --> 00:07:46.720
tortured and killed there.

00:07:47.800 --> 00:07:51.480
It's the site of the worst atrocities committed by the Assad's in Syria.

00:07:52.440 --> 00:07:55.600
We arrive there 48 hours after the fall of the regime.

00:07:59.200 --> 00:07:59.440
STAETAO

00:08:00.640 --> 00:08:00.880
MAETAO

00:08:02.640 --> 00:08:03.520
15279

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:11.960
Including these Turkish aid workers who have been sent to try and uncover all the secrets.

00:08:12.800 --> 00:08:13.640
Hidden jails,

00:08:14.040 --> 00:08:14.840
secret cells,

00:08:15.440 --> 00:08:17.400
kilometers of underground galleries.

00:08:22.480 --> 00:08:28.240
This is where we are.
And I think we need to dig over there.

00:08:28.400 --> 00:08:30.320
Yes, look at the map.

00:08:32.800 --> 00:08:38.080
Given the number of levels,
the tunnel must go at least 10 metres underground.

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:41.120
Be'azid has been coordinating the search since yesterday,

00:08:41.680 --> 00:08:42.920
and like everyone else,

00:08:42.960 --> 00:08:43.440
YESEV

00:08:43.440 --> 00:08:45.480
he's discovering the immensity of the place.

00:08:46.400 --> 00:08:49.320
More than 20,000 inmates were locked up in this prison,

00:08:49.840 --> 00:08:51.760
subjected to severe abuses.

00:08:52.680 --> 00:08:57.240
Those who first arrived on the scene discovered the command centre of the prison complex.

00:08:57.760 --> 00:09:00.480
Look at these poor people still here, locked up.

00:09:02.000 --> 00:09:07.520
Nearly 200 surveillance cameras suggest the existence of secret corridors and hidden cells.

00:09:08.040 --> 00:09:09.520
But they can't find the way in.

00:09:10.200 --> 00:09:11.200
So they are digging,

00:09:11.800 --> 00:09:15.320
hoping to find survivors still trapped in underground dungeons.

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:20.960
Let's start over here.

00:09:24.800 --> 00:09:28.720
Now we're going to start digging at least a metre deep.
We're hoping to find someone.

00:09:41.200 --> 00:09:45.680
It's highly unlikely that we will find survivors.

00:09:45.840 --> 00:09:50.080
As you can see, there were 3 floors above us
and 3 floors below.

00:09:50.240 --> 00:09:54.880
We still can't get in. Whatever's down there
we haven't been able to see yet.

00:09:55.040 --> 00:09:57.840
But, according to the former guards, there's a lot.

00:09:58.000 --> 00:10:03.440
In any case, we're continuing to search,
trying to get there as quickly as possible.

00:10:06.160 --> 00:10:09.040
In the hours following the arrival of the HTS fighters,

00:10:09.400 --> 00:10:10.560
the jails were opened,

00:10:10.960 --> 00:10:11.640
thanks to them.

00:10:22.320 --> 00:10:24.000
Thousands of prisoners were released,

00:10:24.440 --> 00:10:26.360
an unthinkable result for these men,

00:10:26.680 --> 00:10:28.960
who had expected to die behind bars.

00:10:30.240 --> 00:10:32.880
I'm a war veteran. And now I'm free!

00:10:36.240 --> 00:10:38.080
Bashar has fallen!

00:10:41.560 --> 00:10:42.120
Said Naya.

00:10:42.760 --> 00:10:48.040
It was a name that made a whole country shudder until Sunday the 8th of December 2024.

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:49.360
Today,

00:10:49.800 --> 00:10:55.320
hundreds of families around the prison are still looking for missing relatives and have no news of them.

00:10:55.760 --> 00:10:56.240
Beasid?

00:11:01.440 --> 00:11:03.440
Calm down, calm down.

