The smell was unbearable.

00:11:31.920 --> 00:11:35.440
They did this all night,
and then the bulldozers arrived.

00:11:35.600 --> 00:11:40.160
They covered everything with soil
and hid the tracks so you couldn't see anything.

00:11:40.320 --> 00:11:46.880
I went there before that dirty dog Bashar fell
and I know there are bodies there. You have to go there

00:11:47.040 --> 00:11:52.640
I understand, ma'am. But that's not our mission today.
Our priority is to find the survivors.

00:11:52.800 --> 00:11:56.320
That's our responsibility.
The dead... may God look after them.

00:11:57.520 --> 00:11:59.920
How many Syrians have died in Sayed Naya?

00:12:00.960 --> 00:12:05.920
NGOs estimate that at least 30,000 people have been executed since 2011.

00:12:07.400 --> 00:12:08.640
There are no official figures.

00:12:08.840 --> 00:12:11.280
It's the Assad dynasty's best-kept secret.

00:12:15.200 --> 00:12:20.600
The bodies of the last prisoners executed in this prison have been transferred to the Damascus morgue.

