00:13:59.040 --> 00:14:02.800
May God punish these criminals!
May he judge them!

00:14:02.960 --> 00:14:06.880
May God never forgive them.

00:14:07.840 --> 00:14:12.720
He was arrested in the street on his way to the shops.
He was so young.

00:14:13.920 --> 00:14:18.840
Her son was arrested while taking part in demonstrations against the regime in 2013.

00:14:19.400 --> 00:14:20.920
He was 17 years old.

00:14:21.240 --> 00:14:23.240
Trying to find if he's here right now,

00:14:23.320 --> 00:14:25.720
but she cannot even identify the faces.

00:14:26.160 --> 00:14:27.440
Faces are so distorted.

00:14:28.520 --> 00:14:30.840
Because some of the faces of the ex-prisoners,

00:14:30.960 --> 00:14:32.480
they used to be put in an acid,

00:14:32.880 --> 00:14:33.600
or sometimes they're,

00:14:33.760 --> 00:14:34.000
you know,

00:14:34.080 --> 00:14:34.720
