00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:40.960
During all these years of repression and torture,

00:14:41.360 --> 00:14:44.240
the Assad clan continued to grow even richer.

00:14:45.640 --> 00:14:47.480
In addition to the presidential palace,

00:14:47.920 --> 00:14:52.600
Assad and his wife owned a villa in an expensive district in the northwest of the city.

00:14:58.000 --> 00:15:00.720
