00:15:07.880 --> 00:15:13.720
A modern six-story architect-designed villa with a landscaped garden in a well-guarded street.

00:15:20.120 --> 00:15:21.880
This was paid off by the Syrians'

00:15:21.880 --> 00:15:22.080
blood.

00:15:26.320 --> 00:15:26.520
Wow.

