Seems to be wardrobes,

00:15:46.440 --> 00:15:46.960
elevator,

00:15:48.440 --> 00:15:48.960
bathroom.

00:15:50.320 --> 00:15:50.960
This is a balcony,

00:15:51.040 --> 00:15:51.640
just a balcony.

